  "summary": "Agave\u2019s Aave fork burns the collateral aToken and sends the underlying to the liquidator before it finishes updating the borrower\u2019s accounting. Gnosis bridged tokens are ERC-677, so that transfer calls onTokenTransfer on the liquidator, who re-entered borrow() while the position still looked healthy and drew LINK, WETH, USDC, WBTC, GNO and WXDAI against collateral that had already been seized.",
