    "confidence": "high",
    "notes": "Components are the net underlying-token gain of the attacker EOA and its exploit contract across the two transactions that touch the lending pool, at blocks 21120283 and 21120284; the debt tokens minted against them were never repaid. The transaction at block 21120285 only forwards the proceeds from the exploit contract to the EOA. The v1 snapshot carried USD 1,500,000, which is well below the measured amount and below contemporaneous reporting of roughly USD 5.5 million. Nothing was recovered."
