        "description": "The pool is an Aave-fork InitializableImmutableAdminUpgradeabilityProxy, which sets its implementation in the constructor and never emits Upgraded; the proxy emitted no Upgraded event at all between its creation block 15927425 and the exploit. Its EIP-1967 implementation slot is zero at block 15927424 and holds 0x2d5bc0f897ad211ef9f954eadf59c43fb1ec4788 from block 15927425 through block 21120283, so the proxy creation is the change that made the exploited implementation active."
